</div></div></div><h1 property="name">Single-Dose Nirsevimab for Prevention of RSV in Preterm Infants</h1><div class="core-relations my-3"><div class="relation mb-3 HAS_CORRECTION"><div class="relation--head"><i class="icon-info"></i><div>This article has been corrected.</div><a href="https://www.nejm.org/doi/10.1056/NEJMx200019">VIEW THE CORRECTION</a></div></div></div><div class="contributors"><span class="authors"><span class="heading">Authors</span>: <span role="list"><span property="author" role="listitem" typeof="Person"><span property="givenName">M. Pamela</span> <span property="familyName">Griffin</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D.</span></span>, <span property="author" role="listitem" typeof="Person"><span property="givenName">Yuan</span> <span property="familyName">Yuan</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">Ph.D.</span></span>, <span property="author" role="listitem" typeof="Person"><span property="givenName">Therese</span> <span property="familyName">Takas</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">B.S.</span></span>, <span property="author" role="listitem" typeof="Person"><span property="givenName">Joseph B.</span> <span property="familyName">Domachowske</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D.</span></span>, <span property="author" role="listitem" typeof="Person"><span property="givenName">Shabir A.</span> <span property="familyName">Madhi</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.B., B.Ch., Ph.D.</span></span>, <span property="author" role="listitem" typeof="Person"><span property="givenName">Paolo</span> <span property="familyName">Manzoni</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D., Ph.D.</span></span>, <span property="author" role="listitem" typeof="Person"><span property="givenName">Eric A.F.</span> <span property="familyName">Simões</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">M.D.</span></span><span data-displayed-on="all">, <span data-action="reveal" role="button" tabindex="0">+5</span> </span><span data-hidden-on="all">, <span p